From: IvGolovach <20299097+IvGolovach@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] feat(skippy): read selected token scores in causal
 batches

Keep full vocabulary logits on the terminal worker and read bounded
conditional log probabilities before another iteration can replace them.
Readouts do not invoke samplers or advance generation history.
